Upstream package paths, daemon/entrypoint names and core behaviour are retained
to keep the downstream patch small. S2Script-focused extensions replace the
other modding framework updaters and add plugin management, MultiAddonManager
and GameFixes. Images and self-updates use the S2Script repository.

S2Script, Metamod, MultiAddonManager, GameFixes, Valve SteamCMD/SteamRT and
downloaded plugins retain their respective licences and notices. They are
downloaded separately rather than included as implementation source here.
Go and Go module dependencies retain their upstream licences. Container images
include this notice, LICENSE and Go's licence with the compiled entrypoint.
